    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24212" root="صرع" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَرَّعٌ</span></b>  [pass. part. n. of 2, q. v.]. One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَرْتُ بِقَتْلَى مُصَرَّعِينَ</span> [<i>I passed by slain persons
thrown down,</i> or <i>prostrated, on the ground</i>]:
with teshdeed because relating to many objects.
(S.) ― 
